  companion stickers in Game.pak); no art is included in this mod.
  pack.ps1 converts this file to _merged.lsf. The IDs are referenced from
  ScriptExtender/Lua/UI/Theme.lua (T.Portraits); tools/build_data.py checks both.
-->
